#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate the Russian dictionaries of the swarm stack panels.

The panels ask the locale runtime for a key and fall back to their own
English table, so a Russian dictionary must carry the SAME keys. This script
reads the extracted key sets (`dsh-ru-keys`) and writes the `ru` tables into
the client bundle of dsh-local-ru.

Naming rule: technology names, API names, commands, formats and product
names stay English (swarm, worktree, token, commit, git, npm, MCP, UltraCode,
prompt, tool, plugin, session, provider, agent, subagent, model, context,
plan, review, gate, stream, timeout, retry, CI/CD, ...). Everything else is
Russian.
"""
